      "value": "@{6161a61a2c0de966b4e43486|full_name}: Here it seems to be actually affected by irl rotation, turning about 90 degrees to the right. Switching the elbow trackers, or putting them above and below the elbow joint didnt affect anything.\nThe same trackers work perfectly for the knees, with no offset at any irl rotation.",
